这也是一种选择
That was a choice.

360
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:55,080
你看起来
You look...

361
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:56,720
你今晚看起来真漂亮
you look really pretty tonight.

362
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:57,850
谢谢
Thanks.

363
00:15:57,850 --> 00:15:59,130
你的外套也不错
I love that jacket.

364
00:15:59,130 --> 00:16:01,250
谢谢  谢谢
Thank you. Thanks, thanks.

365
00:16:03,810 --> 00:16:05,400
对不起  我做不到
I'm sorry. I can't do this.

366
00:16:05,400 --> 00:16:07,520
我的前女友给我发了电邮
My... my ex-girlfriend e-mailed me,

367
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:08,820
我周六会和她见面
and I'm seeing her Saturday...

368
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:11,710
我很高兴你觉得我外套好看  是克鲁牌的
And I'm glad you like it-- it's from J. Crew.

369
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:14,840
我不明白
I don't understand.

370
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:15,750
我的朋友们告诉我
My friends told me it was okay

371
00:16:15,750 --> 00:16:17,540
同时和多个人约会没问题
to see more than one person at a time,

372
00:16:17,540 --> 00:16:20,370
但我感觉我在欺骗你
but it-it feels like I'm being deceitful.

373
00:16:20,370 --> 00:16:22,430
你会和她复合吗
Are you getting back together with her?

374
00:16:22,870 --> 00:16:23,620
不
No.

375
00:16:23,620 --> 00:16:25,460
我不知道
I-I... I have no idea.

376
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:26,960
如果是你会怎么做
What would you do?

377
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:30,720
通常第一次约会  我会谈谈音乐什么的
Uh, usually on first dates, I talk about music and stuff,

378
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:33,790
但既然说好了你是怪人  就谈这个吧
but I was promised weird, so let's do this.

379
00:16:35,050 --> 00:16:36,950
你们之前有多认真
How serious were you two?

380
00:16:36,950 --> 00:16:38,860
说实话
Well, to be honest,

381
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:40,800
我们只约会过四次
we only went on four dates,

382
00:16:40,800 --> 00:16:42,480
拥抱过两次  吻过一次
hugged twice, kissed once,

383
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:46,040
还有一个充满了性暗示的握手
and there was a handshake loaded with sexual innuendo.

384
00:16:49,100 --> 00:16:50,370
慢着
Wait, so...

385
00:16:50,370 --> 00:16:52,870
一个你从没"睡"过的女生发了电邮给你
a girl you never slept with sent you an e-mail

386
00:16:52,870 --> 00:16:55,700
让你内疚到你觉得必须告诉我吗
and you felt so guilty about it that you had to tell me?

387
00:16:55,700 --> 00:16:56,650
是的
Yeah.

388
00:16:57,210 --> 00:16:59,510
挺可爱的
That's kind of adorable.

389
00:16:59,510 --> 00:17:01,310
你说真的吗
Are you... are you sure?

390
00:17:01,310 --> 00:17:02,910
因为一般约会到了这个环节
Because this is the part of the night

391
00:17:02,910 --> 00:17:05,090
都是我说了傻话  女生就直接走了
where I've said something stupid and the girl usually leaves.

392
00:17:05,090 --> 00:17:06,830
我还没走啊
I'm still here.

393
00:17:06,830 --> 00:17:10,040
但现在你让我怀疑你到底有什么毛病
Yeah, but now you make me wonder what's wrong with you.

394
00:17:11,860 --> 00:17:13,280
我们刚认识
We just met.

395
00:17:13,280 --> 00:17:16,110
你不必告诉我  你约会的其他人
You don't need to tell me about other people you're seeing.

396
00:17:16,110 --> 00:17:17,600
真的吗
Really?

397
00:17:17,600 --> 00:17:19,630
因为"我同时和两个女生约会"
Because "I'm dating two women"

398
00:17:19,630 --> 00:17:23,650
基本上是我唯一可吹嘘的潮男事迹
is basically the only cool thing I can say about myself.

399
00:17:34,250 --> 00:17:37,830
一方面  Xbox One的摄像头更好
On the one hand, the Xbox One has a better camera...

400
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:41,550
但PS4可随意换硬盘
but the PS4 has a removable hard drive.

401
00:17:41,550 --> 00:17:43,400
有何想法
Thoughts?

402
00:17:44,230 --> 00:17:46,600
我的腿麻了
I can't feel my legs.

403
00:17:49,190 --> 00:17:51,030
不好意思  两位
Oh... I'm sorry, guys,

404
00:17:51,030 --> 00:17:52,630
商店五分钟前就关门了
but the store closed five minutes ago.

405
00:17:53,100 --> 00:17:54,920
但我还没决定好买哪个
But I haven't decided yet.

406
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:55,910
那你就明天再来买
You'll have to come back tomorrow.

407
00:17:55,910 --> 00:17:57,880
收银机已经关了
The registers are closed.

408
00:18:02,010 --> 00:18:03,520
咱们去吃点东西吧
Let's get you some food.

409
00:18:03,520 --> 00:18:05,510
吃了东西后你就会感觉好些
Y-You'll feel better after you eat.

410
00:18:05,510 --> 00:18:07,740
好的
Okay.

411
00:18:07,750 --> 00:18:09,880
你想吃什么  泰国菜
What-what do you want, like, Thai food?

412
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:11,330
还是汉堡
A... A burger?

413
00:18:11,330 --> 00:18:13,880
人家不知道嘛
I don't know!

414
00:18:24,460 --> 00:18:27,000
看  一枚硬币
Hey, look, a quarter!

415
00:18:36,050 --> 00:18:37,260
感觉如何
How's that feel?

416
00:18:37,260 --> 00:18:38,000
非常好
Great.

417
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:40,900
完全"不后悔"
Not like regret at all.

418
00:18:42,890 --> 00:18:44,200
佩妮
Penny?

419
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:46,890
我们是同事了
We're working together!

420
00:18:47,390 --> 00:18:49,700
太棒了
Awesome!

